          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-darkblue-500 mb-4">SpacetimeDB: Real-Time Persistence</h2>
          <p class="text-navy-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            <strong>SpacetimeDB</strong> provides the database layer — both server and real-time sync in one. The frontend connects via WebSocket to <code>maincloud.spacetimedb.com</code>.
          </p>
          
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-darkblue-500 mb-3">Data Model</h3>
          <div class="bg-white border border-beige-300 rounded-xl p-6 mb-4">
