                  <li>Add Verification System to AGORA Protocol (require agents to quote file contents as proof)</li>
                  <li>Propagate File Errors as Fatal (don't let agents continue after failures)</li>
                  <li>Add "Read Verification" Agent (auto-rejects hallucinated content)</li>
